- [ ] P004: 补充曲线箭头回归覆盖 <!-- scope: test/serialization_test.dart,test/svg_exporter_test.dart,test/curve_element_test.dart,test/canvas_controller_test.dart -->
  - 验收要点：覆盖曲线启用和关闭箭头、headSize 缩放、边界和命中测试包含箭头影响的模型行为。
